  "body": "https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#interface-wiring\n\nThe style of the spec in this section is a bit atypical. A section title \"Extensions to the Navigator Interface\" and a partial interface Navigator would be more in line with other specs:\n\nhttp://dev.w3.org/csswg/cssom/#extensions-to-the-document-interface\nhttp://dev.w3.org/csswg/cssom-view/#extensions-to-the-element-interface\nhttp://w3c.github.io/webcomponents/spec/shadow/#extensions-to-element-interface\n",
